+#else
+/* 4.19 calls clone on the source and dedupe on the destination. The old
+ * callbacks return int status, not a byte count, and have no flags argument.
+ * Keep both ends as real filesystem files; never pass wrapper private_data
+ * to a filesystem callback. VFS retains the incoming file references.
